{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"单对象"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"单对象"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>在 "},{"Local":{"url":"Abel范畴","text":"Abel 范畴"}},{"Plain":"中, <strong>单对象</strong>是仅有两个子对象 ($0$ 与自身) 的对象.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Schur引理","text":"Schur 引理"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}